 <h3><u>Shehzada e qasim janam</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Shah qasim jaanam..(8) Ya qasim jaan<br> Dulha qasim, qasim..(2) shaah qasim..(2)<br> shahzada e qasim jaanam, ae nawjawanam<br> khush aamdeed wa maidan e karbala qasim<br> shah qasim janam</p> 
  <p>1. Kamar me patka sajakar wo maahtaab chala, shah qasim<br> sawale bay'ate fasiq ka ek jawaab chala, shah qasim<br> hasan ka laal misaale abu turaab chala<br> to karbala bhi, adab se boli<br> khush aamdeed...</p> 
  <p>2. Khayam e shaah se wo shane kirdigaar chala, shah qasim<br> husaini fauj ka mu bolta wiqaar chala<br> ajal bikherta maqtal me raahwaar chala<br> fida tumhare, nabi hai saare<br> khush aamdeed..</p> 
  <p>3. Rajaz labo'n pe sajai ba rasme islami, shah qasim<br> Abu turaab ka beta hu kaisi nakaami<br> kahan chupa hai wo badkaar arzaq e shaami<br> jo dekhe tewar, to bole haider<br> khush aamdeed..</p> 
  <p>4. Jo khainchi ghaiz me aakar husaam qasim ne, shah qasim<br> udoo se pucha bataa aur naam qasim ne<br> kiya laeeno ka jeena haram qasim ne<br> wafa pukari, qaza pukari<br> khush aamdeed...</p> 
  <p>5. Wigha ko arzaq e shaami ke do pisar aaye, shah qasim<br> zara si der mein ghode se khaak par aaye<br> zamee'n pe laashe hawao'n me sar nazar aaye<br> paro'n ko tole, farishte bole<br> khush aamdeed...</p> 
  <p>6. Jo aaya arzaq e shaami sambhale qalbo jigar, shah qasim<br> hasan ka laal badha qehre kibriya bankar<br> badan ko bhi na khabar thi ke kab hua besar<br> faza me naara, hasan ka goonja<br> Khush aamdeed..</p> 
  <p>7. Ghira laeeno'n me nagaah gul badan qasim, shah qasim<br> sumo se ghodo'n ke uljha wo khasta tan qasim<br> bikhar gaya kai tukdo me be watan qasim<br> zameen royi, ye roke boli<br> khush aamdeed...</p> 
  <p>8. Husain dasht me pohche the marsiya padhte, shah qasim<br> ebaa zamee'n pe bichakar utha liye tukde<br> ebaa ko dosh pe rakha ye bayn karte huwe<br> mai roya dilbar, ye baat keh kar<br> khush aamdeed...</p> 
  <p>9. Yahi pe mazhar o irfan khatm hai nauha, shah qasim<br> bikhar gaya sare maqtal wo qasim e naushaah<br> radeef bangaya qirtaas par yahi misra<br> shah qasim jaanam, ae nawjawanam<br> khush aamdeed wa maidan e karbala qasim</p> 
  <p>shahzada e qasim jaanam, ae nawjawanam<br> khush aamdeed wa maidan e karbala qasim<br> shah qasim janam..(6)</p> 
